{"id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-reflection-principle.md","title":"Reflection Principle","display":"df-reflection-principle — Reflection Principle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-reflection-principle","aliases":["92-df-reflection-principle"],"display":"df-reflection-principle — Reflection Principle","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-local-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-reflection-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-reflection-principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflection-principle — Reflection Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"762abc58e37c6f85\" href=\"?note=762abc58e37c6f85\" title=\"92-df-local-reflection\">92-df-local-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (provability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G\\)</span> (local-reflection constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"762abc58e37c6f85\" href=\"?note=762abc58e37c6f85\" title=\"92-df-local-reflection\">92-df-local-reflection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_G\\)</span> (definition-target reflection-schema constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}\n=\n\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}\n=\n\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_G(\\Gamma)\\)</span> : 由句子类<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>索引的局部反射模式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\)</span> : “如果<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”</li>\n<li>反射原理断言可证性蕴含真理</li>\n<li>添加反射原理可增强系统</li>\n<li>本文件复用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G\\)</span>，并把定义域和值域明确为句子集的幂集；它不是一条把集合量化直接写进对象语言的单句</li>\n<li>统一反射模式与外部全局反射分别见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ef45fe4bdcb94272\" href=\"?note=ef45fe4bdcb94272\" title=\"92-df-universal-reflection\">92-df-universal-reflection</a>和<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"11c6019276c591ed\" href=\"?note=11c6019276c591ed\" title=\"92-df-global-reflection\">92-df-global-reflection</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"762abc58e37c6f85","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-local-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_G$ (provability predicate, see [[92-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence class, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","